{
  "A text input with a list that filters as the user types. Items can come from memory or from a data layer source that is searched on the server. `Autocomplete` is the free-text variant, where the value is the text itself.": "",
  "With `dataSource`, the search goes to the data source (using its `searchFields`) after `searchDelay`. In `'blocks'` mode, only the visible rows load, and a value that is not on a loaded page is looked up by key so the field can show its text immediately. This example has 10,000 products and responds after 300 ms.": "",
  "Custom values and Autocomplete": "Özel değerler ve Autocomplete",
  "Accepts the highlighted item, or the text (see `acceptCustomValue`), and closes the list.": "",
  "If an item's text matches the input, it is selected. Otherwise, the custom value is used or the selected item is restored.": "",
  "Closes the list. When closed, it reverts the typing, and then clears the value with `clearButton`.": "",
  "The APG combobox with list autocomplete. The input has `role=\"combobox\"`, `aria-autocomplete=\"list\"`, `aria-expanded` and `aria-controls`.": "",
  "Rows not loaded yet are options with `aria-busy`, which announce \"Loading…\" from `uiLocale`.": "",
  "The value of the selected item. `x-model` binds it.": "",
  "Same as DropDown. Groups apply to in-memory items.": "",
  "How in-memory items are matched.": "",
  "The number of characters to type before the list opens.": "",
  "Text that matches no item becomes the value. Otherwise, the field reverts to the selected item.": "",
  "Highlights the first match, so Enter accepts it.": "",
  "The arrow that opens all items, and the button that clears the value.": "",
  "Same as DropDown.": "",
  "The item for the current value, when known.": "",
  "The list and the value.": "Liste ve değer.",
  "Your items can be plain or reactive, and the box reads them as they are. After changing them in place, call `refresh()`. The open list and the value text update. Autocomplete has the same method.": "",
  "The items logic is a shared part: `DataItems` supplies any list control from an array or a data source.": ""
}
